  "reasoning": "The defendant raised funds from a large number of people without approval, promising high interest and using his factories as collateral. The collected money was largely used for personal consumption and could not be returned, resulting in huge losses. This matches the statutory offense of illegal acceptance of public deposits (非法吸收公众存款罪), which is applied to fraudulent fundraising activities of this nature. No other distinct crimes are indicated.",
